# Leovold, Emissary of Trest: only a spell or ability an OPPONENT controls targeting YOU or a permanent you control
# triggers it. Bot2 bolts its own Ornithopter (an opponent's spell, but not Bot1's permanent), and on turn 3 Bot1 bolts
# Bot2's other Ornithopter (Bot1's own spell): no trigger on the stack either time, and no draw prompt. The positive control is
# the neighbouring scenario.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
